WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.000
Hey, this is Presh Talwalkar

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:08.600
A party has 100 people who are either liars or truth tellers

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.380
Liars always lie

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.560
And truth tellers always speak the truth

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.100
After the party is over

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.280
You ask each person

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.060
"How many truth tellers did you shake hands with?"

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.920
Each person gave a different answer

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.760
Ranging from the numbers 0 to 99

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.260
The answers were the whole numbers from 0 to 99

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.580
How many liars were at the party?

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.460
Give this problem a try and when you're ready, keep watching the video for the solution

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.220
This logic problem seems impossible

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.020
Because you do not know

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.500
Which people shook hands with each other

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.540
However

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.840
We can deduce from their answers

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.700
How many people at the party were truth tellers

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.620
And how many people are liars

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.380
We'll start by labeling each person

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.220
We'll say person 99 is the one who replied

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:22.520
To have shaken hands with 99 truth tellers

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.540
Similarly, person 98

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:30.040
said to have shaken hands with 98 truth tellers

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.400
We'll continue this labeling all the way down to person 0

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.140
Who shook hands with 0 truth tellers

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.940
Let's consider first person 99

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:47.280
Imagine person 99 was a truth teller

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.700
What could we deduce from that?

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.000
If person 99 is a truth teller

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:59.000
That would mean person 99 must have shaken hands

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.560
With everyone else

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.200
All other 99 people at the party

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.600
And

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.860
Because that person said they shook hands with 99 truth tellers

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.520
That means everyone else at the party

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.640
Must also be a truth teller

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:19.660
But person 99 would have then also have shook hands with person 0

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:24.260
Who is said to have shaken hands with 0 truth tellers

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:29.760
How can person 0 have shaken hands with 0 truth tellers?

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.260
and be a truth teller?

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:36.820
One possibility is that 99 and 0 did not shake hands

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.900
This would mean person 99 is a liar

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:41.400
Or

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.940
Person 0 shook hands only with liars

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.820
Which would also mean person 99 is a liar

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:55.220
It's not logically possible for person 99 to be a truth teller

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:59.220
Therefore, person 99 must be a liar

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.400
We will identify person 99 accordingly

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.180
Now that we know person 99 is a liar

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.920
What else can we figure out?

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.700
Let's look at person 98

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.740
If person 98 is a truth teller

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.780
That would mean person 98 shook hands with persons 0 to 97

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.480
And all of those people must be truth tellers

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.360
We can make this deduction because we know 99 is a liar

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:34.220
If you exclude person 99

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.760
We're left with person 0 to 97

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.900
Which are only 98 people

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.520
So the only way person 98 could be a truth teller

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.980
And shake hands with 98 people

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.360
Is that person 98 would have shaken hands with person 0 to 97

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.440
who must all be truth tellers

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:57.100
But this would mean person 98 also shook hands with person 0

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.980
Who is said to have shaken hands with 0 truth tellers

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:07.360
Once again this is possible only if 98 and 0 did not shake hands

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.640
Which would make person 98 a liar

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:10.780
Or

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.180
Person 0 shook hands only with liars

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.580
Which would once again mean that person 98 is a liar

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.180
In either possibility

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.320
We can conclude person 98 is not a truth teller

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:28.380
And therefore, person 98 must be a liar

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.140
We will label person 98 accordingly

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.460
Now we can continue this process

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:44.660
We can then inductively prove persons 97, 96, and so on, all the way down to person 1

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.380
must all be liars

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.720
We'll label each person accordingly

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:54.740
What about person 0?

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.180
We've already figured out that persons 1 to person 99 is a liar

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:04.600
Everyone else at the party is a liar

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:11.000
Therefore, person 0 necessarily shake hands with only liars

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:14.380
There are 0 truth tellers that person 0 can shake hands with

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.120
This means person 0 is telling the truth

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.820
and is therefore a truth teller

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.900
So the answer to this problem

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.760
Is that there are 99 liars

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:31.580
Persons 1 to 99

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.380
And exactly 1 truth teller

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.660
Which is person 0

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:38.080
Did you figure out this problem?

